    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20631" root="سمج" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُجَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُجَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَاجَةٌ</span> (S, O, Msb, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُمُوجَةٌ</span>; (L, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمِجَ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَجَ</span></b> ,] (Lh,
TA, and so in a copy of the A,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَاجَةٌ</span>;
(A;) <i>It</i> (a thing, S, O, Msb) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
foul, unseemly,</i> or <i>ugly;</i> (S, A, O, Msb, * K;)
or <i>devoid of beauty.</i> (A, L, Msb.)

